              <Tracking event="adCollapse"><![CDATA[https://httpbin.org/status/200?layer=dsp&event=collapse]]></Tracking>
              <Tracking event="minimize"><![CDATA[https://httpbin.org/status/200?layer=dsp&event=minimize]]></Tracking>
